Q: google.script.run problem on Google Apps Script A: <p>The problem is not here, you have to evaluate your form by a script included in gs like this one (change names as necessary, inside this script)</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>function lister() {
  const html = HtmlService
    .createTemplateFromFile('formList')
    .evaluate();
  SpreadsheetApp.getUi().showModelessDialog(html, 'Lister ...');
}
